<title>UK: Pakistan's Adamjee opens London branch.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Adamjee opens London branch.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Adamjee Insurance Company Ltd started operations in the UK when it inaugurated its first branch in the City of London financial district on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company has maintained a contact office in London for the past few years, catering to the sizeable population from the Indian sub-continent.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
